WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose how to start. This choice prepares the shared Sandbox for your workspace.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Samples or your own test data. Explore complete fictional businesses, or start empty and use the API.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Load the sample businesses. An Owner can prepare six businesses and their related records.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Wait for preparation to finish. The video shortens this wait. Setup continues until the records are ready.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Your workspace is ready. The confirmation closes automatically when preparation completes.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Explore the scenario tools. Inspect example journeys, expected results and API requests.

7
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Find the generated records. Open Origination to see all six businesses and their different outcomes.
